                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This dataset includes a model to simulate land system changes in China from 2015 to 2050 using the CLUMondo model. The zip-file includes four completely parameterized model applications (one for each scenario), the initial land systems map for the year 2015, the python scripts to call the models, and the scenario results. All files are raster files in *.asc format."
